	(text "One shift clock for both registers: PIO1 shifts the next strobe pattern into the 595 while the 74HC165 chain shifts in (ARCHITECTURE.md 5.3-5.4).\nStrobes: 595 output high -> MMBT3904 on -> strobe pulled low (active), with the original 1 k pull-up to +4.5 V and 100 nF.\nJ1 keeps the original pinout (key on pin 2). Strobes 5-8 are driven even where a game does not use them (Q15)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "841c38f9-5b45-5de8-a0e5-851aab5cc4d3")
	)
